rse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja491:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja491:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja491:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja491:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja491:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja491:14.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:14.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:14.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:14.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja491:15.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:15.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:15.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:15.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja491:16.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:16.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:16.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:16.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja491:17.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:17.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:17.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja491:17.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja491:18.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja491:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja491:0.2": "Pakiṇṇakanipāta ", "ja491:0.3": "Sālikedāravagga ", "ja491:0.4": "8. Mahāmorajātaka ", "ja491:1.1": "“Sace hi tyāhaṁ dhanahetu gāhito, ", "ja491:1.2": "Mā maṁ vadhī jīvagāhaṁ gahetvā; ", "ja491:1.3": "Rañño ca maṁ samma upantikaṁ nehi, ", "ja491:1.4": "Maññe dhanaṁ lacchasinapparūpaṁ”. ", "ja491:2.1": "“Na me ayaṁ tuyha vadhāya ajja, ", "ja491:2.2": "Samāhito cāpadhure khurappo; ", "ja491:2.3": "Pāsañca tyāhaṁ adhipātayissaṁ, ", "ja491:2.4": "Yathāsukhaṁ gacchatu morarājā”. ", "ja491:3.1": "“Yaṁ satta vassāni mamānubandhi, ", "ja491:3.2": "Rattindivaṁ khuppipāsaṁ sahanto; ", "ja491:3.3": "Atha kissa maṁ pāsavasūpanītaṁ, ", "ja491:3.4": "Pamuttave icchasi bandhanasmā. ", "ja491:4.1": "Pāṇātipātā virato nusajja, ", "ja491:4.2": "Abhayaṁ nu te sabbabhūtesu dinnaṁ; ", "ja491:4.3": "Yaṁ maṁ tuvaṁ pāsavasūpanītaṁ, ", "ja491:4.4": "Pamuttave icchasi bandhanasmā”. ", "ja491:5.1": "“Pāṇātipātā viratassa brūhi, ", "ja491:5.2": "Abhayañca yo sabbabhūtesu deti; ", "ja491:5.3": "Pucchāmi taṁ morarājetamatthaṁ, ", "ja491:5.4": "Ito cuto kiṁ labhate sukhaṁ so”. ", "ja491:6.1": "“Pāṇātipātā viratassa brūmi, ", "ja491:6.2": "Abhayañca yo sabbabhūtesu deti; ", "ja491:6.3": "Diṭṭheva dhamme labhate pasaṁsaṁ, ", "ja491:6.4": "Saggañca so yāti sarīrabhedā”. ", "ja491:7.1": "“Na santi devā iti āhu eke, ", "ja491:7.2": "Idheva jīvo vibhavaṁ upeti; ", "ja491:7.3": "Tathā phalaṁ sukatadukkaṭānaṁ, ", "ja491:7.4": "Dattupaññattañca vadanti dānaṁ; ", "ja491:7.5": "Tesaṁ vaco arahataṁ saddahāno, ", "ja491:7.6": "Tasmā ahaṁ sakuṇe bādhayāmi”. ", "ja491:8.1": "“Cando ca suriyo ca ubho sudassanā, ", "ja491:8.2": "Gacchanti obhāsayamantalikkhe; ", "ja491:8.3": "Imassa lokassa parassa vā te, ", "ja491:8.4": "Kathaṁ nu te āhu manussaloke”. ", "ja491:9.1": "“Cando ca suriyo ca ubho sudassanā, ", "ja491:9.2": "Gacchanti obhāsayamantalikkhe; ", "ja491:9.3": "Parassa lokassa na te imassa, ", "ja491:9.4": "Devāti te āhu manussaloke”. ", "ja491:10.1": "“Ettheva te nīhatā hīnavādā, ", "ja491:10.2": "Ahetukā ye na vadanti kammaṁ; ", "ja491:10.3": "Tathā phalaṁ sukatadukkaṭānaṁ, ", "ja491:10.4": "Dattupaññattaṁ ye ca vadanti dānaṁ”. ", "ja491:11.1": "“Addhā hi saccaṁ vacanaṁ tavedaṁ, ", "ja491:11.2": "Kathañhi dānaṁ aphalaṁ bhaveyya; ", "ja491:11.3": "Tathā phalaṁ sukatadukkaṭānaṁ, ", "ja491:11.4": "Dattupaññattañca kathaṁ bhaveyya. ", "ja491:12.1": "Kathaṅkaro kintikaro kimācaraṁ, ", "ja491:12.2": "Kiṁ sevamāno kena tapoguṇena; ", "ja491:12.3": "Akkhāhi me morarājetamatthaṁ, ", "ja491:12.4": "Yathā ahaṁ no nirayaṁ pateyyaṁ”. ", "ja491:13.1": "“Ye keci atthi samaṇā pathabyā, ", "ja491:13.2": "Kāsāyavatthā anagāriyā te; ", "ja491:13.3": "Pātova piṇḍāya caranti kāle, ", "ja491:13.4": "Vikālacariyā viratā hi santo. ", "ja491:14.1": "Te tattha kālenupasaṅkamitvā, ", "ja491:14.2": "Pucchāhi yaṁ te manaso piyaṁ siyā; ", "ja491:14.3": "Te te pavakkhanti yathāpajānaṁ, ", "ja491:14.4": "Imassa lokassa parassa catthaṁ”. ", "ja491:15.1": "“Tacaṁva jiṇṇaṁ urago purāṇaṁ, ", "ja491:15.2": "Paṇḍūpalāsaṁ harito dumova; ", "ja491:15.3": "Esappahīno mama luddabhāvo, ", "ja491:15.4": "Jahāmahaṁ luddakabhāvamajja. ", "ja491:16.1": "Ye cāpi me sakuṇā atthi baddhā, ", "ja491:16.2": "Satāninekāni nivesanasmiṁ; ", "ja491:16.3": "Tesampahaṁ jīvitamajja dammi, ", "ja491:16.4": "Mokkhañca te pattā sakaṁ niketaṁ”. ", "ja491:17.1": "“Luddo carī pāsahattho araññe, ", "ja491:17.2": "Bādhetu morādhipatiṁ yasassiṁ; ", "ja491:17.3": "Bandhitvā morādhipatiṁ yasassiṁ, ", "ja491:17.4": "Dukkhā sa pamucci yathāhaṁ pamutto”ti. ", "ja491:18.1": "Mahāmorajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja491:0.1": "", "ja491:0.2": "", "ja491:0.3": "", "ja491:0.4": "", "ja491:1.1": "", "ja491:1.2": "", "ja491:1.3": "Rañño ca → raññova (pts-vp-pli1) | upantikaṁ → upenti (bj); upanti (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja491:1.4": "", "ja491:2.1": "", "ja491:2.2": "cāpadhure → cāpavare (bj, pts-vp-pli1); cāpavaro (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja491:2.3": ""